    postalStrategy: "EDDM at $0.223 per piece was the ideal postal approach for this campaign. The target was geographic (people who live near the facility) rather than demographic, making EDDM's every-household delivery model a perfect fit. No mailing list was needed — the routes were selected based on proximity to the Ladson facility. The total campaign cost for postage, printing, and design was a fraction of what a single month of sponsored job board postings would cost for the same geographic area, with the added advantage of reaching passive job seekers who would never see an online posting.",
